# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/
/coverage/

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# Golden-test failure artifacts — Flutter auto-writes these into
# `test/goldens/failures/` on every failing run (master + test + two diff
# PNGs per failing test). They're build outputs, not source: nothing reads
# them back, and `flutter test --update-goldens` regenerates the tracked
# masters from scratch. Keep them out of history.
test/goldens/failures/

# App secrets — API keys / SDK tokens / anything we don't want in git
# history or code review. Kept alongside `env/<staging|preprod|prod>.json`
# for locality but NEVER committed. Sibling `env/prabhujiSecrets.example.json`
# (when it exists) is committed as a template with placeholder values.
env/prabhujiSecrets.json
